      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You carry a heavy weight of hopelessness that makes every small connection feel impossible, and it is incredibly lonely when the outside world moves too fast for you to keep up. While pretending to see when the darkness feels permanent takes a terrifying amount of strength, the exhaustion of this battle often leaves us utterly drained instead of safe. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line or a trusted friend today, even if you can only speak for a moment, so you don't have to walk through this dark hallway completely alone.",
